            <title>[IGNITE-1048] Deadlock is possible in atomic cache update on partition create</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-1048</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This scenario was observed in test (see code in GridDhtAtomicCache.updateAllAsyncInternal0):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
